alysis","static-analysis","taint-analysis","type-inference"],"visibility":"public","forks":684,"open_issues":1949,"watchers":5784,"default_branch":"6.x","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"When using specific metatypes (i.e. more specific than `class-string`), type information should be available about the type's static interface to enable some cool meta-programming (use of the `new` operator *is* currently supported however [*isn't really checked*](https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/issues/1143)):\r\n\r\nhttps://getpsalm.org/r/ed7e36beae\r\n\r\n```php\r\n<?php\r\n\r\nclass Foo\r\n{\r\n    public static function someInt(): int\r\n    {\r\n        return 1;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * @return int\r\n */\r\nfunction makeInt()\r\n{\r\n    $fooClass = Foo::class;\r\n    return $fooClass::someInt();\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nPsalm output (using commit d70f853): \r\n```\r\nINFO: MixedReturnStatement - 17:5 - Could not infer a return type\r\n\r\nINFO: MixedInferredReturnType - 12:12 - Could not verify return type 'int' for makeInt\r\n```\r\n\r\nExpected:\r\n```\r\nNo issues!\r\n```","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1142/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1142/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":2042343188,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDIwNDIzNDMxODg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/events/2042343188","actor":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/o